This directory contains the software results of the Research Funding
Program of AITEC, titled "Improving the Runtime System of KLIC" and
related documents.

The top-level subdirectories of this directory are the following.

    Documents:
	Manuals and other documents of the software
    Sources:
	Source programs, examples, and outputs of the examples

Each directory contains the following subdirectories.

    enhanced-klic:	KLIC enhanced with the "goal-object" feature
    ddu:		Tracer written in KL1 itself
    skuld:		An automatic load-distribution mechanism
    KAbI:		An abstract interpreter for KL1
    KL1PP:		A pretty printer for KL1
    ILP-MGTP:		An inductive logic programming system upon MGTP

However, the directory Sources/enhanced-klic is lacking.  We decided
that, to avoid making different versions of KLIC being distributed, we 
should not include a KLIC system here, and merge the enhanced features 
to the normal release of KLIC.  Please use the newest release of KLIC
for the enhanced features.

